Title: "Overview"
Id: "cbb1f47b-5d4c-4c8b-9866-0bc94717415b"

Text: "`overview:` is an open-text documented item.

```mlg-fragment
Documented:
. overview: \"A short overview of this item.\"
```

It is parsed as prose metadata. For longer rendered prose above a card, prefer `description:`."
Id: "b4d50233-ea97-4d75-ad63-0d4f3627c6d0"
